.    loop\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns / \d+.\d+ns 
.    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns \(x 4\) / \d+.\d+ns \(x 4\) 
.    .    seq\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns / \d+.\d+ns 
.    .    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns \(x 3\) / \d+.\d+ns \(x 3\) 
.    .    .    loop\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns / \d+.\d+ns 
.    .    .    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns \(x 9\) / \d+.\d+ns \(x 9\) 
.    .    .    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns \(x 6\) / \d+.\d+ns \(x 6\) 
.    .    .    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns \(x 3\) / \d+.\d+ns \(x 3\) 
.    block\(\d+\)\s+: \d+.\d+ns \(x 1\) / \d+.\d+ns \(x 1\) 

